{"3228230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Earthquake: Margarita School - Definitive Edition", "steam_appid": 3228230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Main story</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/b923dec21203ec54f5e94441472db1ae.poster.avif?t=1783526505\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/b923dec21203ec54f5e94441472db1ae.webm?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/b923dec21203ec54f5e94441472db1ae.mp4?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a police officer assigned to investigate an earthquake at the renowned &quot;Santa Margarita&quot; school at year 2003.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/cc488da7d8c6ecd1538cfebb65af9a0c.poster.avif?t=1783526505\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/cc488da7d8c6ecd1538cfebb65af9a0c.webm?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/cc488da7d8c6ecd1538cfebb65af9a0c.mp4?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your mission is to uncover the truth behind the incident and reveal the school's dark, hidden history. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your investigation, you'll encounter various paranormal events that defy explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/8af3a5c8e515519b779dbbd9fec91821.poster.avif?t=1783526505\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/8af3a5c8e515519b779dbbd9fec91821.webm?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/8af3a5c8e515519b779dbbd9fec91821.mp4?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or can you unravel the mysteries? Additionally, you must complete a small list of puzzles that you must discover throughout the first floor of the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/37ebb4160c22d1a33b99deeca926b828.poster.avif?t=1783526505\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/37ebb4160c22d1a33b99deeca926b828.webm?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/37ebb4160c22d1a33b99deeca926b828.mp4?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Game features:</i></strong>  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duration of 1.5 hours </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS style </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set on Halloween dates </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NORMAL level puzzles </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains gory material and may be sensitive for some audiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>THE GAME WILL BE GETTING MORE CONTENT AS UPDATES GO BY</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be happy to bring you new content and solve problems in future updates!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Main story</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/b923dec21203ec54f5e94441472db1ae.poster.avif?t=1783526505\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/b923dec21203ec54f5e94441472db1ae.webm?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/b923dec21203ec54f5e94441472db1ae.mp4?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a police officer assigned to investigate an earthquake at the renowned &quot;Santa Margarita&quot; school at year 2003.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/cc488da7d8c6ecd1538cfebb65af9a0c.poster.avif?t=1783526505\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/cc488da7d8c6ecd1538cfebb65af9a0c.webm?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/cc488da7d8c6ecd1538cfebb65af9a0c.mp4?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your mission is to uncover the truth behind the incident and reveal the school's dark, hidden history. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your investigation, you'll encounter various paranormal events that defy explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/8af3a5c8e515519b779dbbd9fec91821.poster.avif?t=1783526505\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/8af3a5c8e515519b779dbbd9fec91821.webm?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/8af3a5c8e515519b779dbbd9fec91821.mp4?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or can you unravel the mysteries? Additionally, you must complete a small list of puzzles that you must discover throughout the first floor of the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/37ebb4160c22d1a33b99deeca926b828.poster.avif?t=1783526505\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/37ebb4160c22d1a33b99deeca926b828.webm?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/37ebb4160c22d1a33b99deeca926b828.mp4?t=1783526505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Game features:</i></strong>  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duration of 1.5 hours </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS style </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set on Halloween dates </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NORMAL level puzzles </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains gory material and may be sensitive for some audiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>THE GAME WILL BE GETTING MORE CONTENT AS UPDATES GO BY</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be happy to bring you new content and solve problems in future updates!</p>", "short_description": "A horror game set in a school, in which you will be a police officer who will have to investigate an earthquake. You will have to complete puzzles and face the paranormal events that occur. You have to be careful, the school covers a fairly dark past that you will be able to discover.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/header.jpg?t=1783526505", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/d092048749e67579e14e8f8ae665768787a4e8b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783526505", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/d092048749e67579e14e8f8ae665768787a4e8b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783526505", "website": "https://www.papustudio.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br><